In your own game, this can be worked around by using:

```cs
public override void _Notification(int what)
{
    switch ((long)what)
    {
        case NotificationWMMouseExit:
            Input.ParseInputEvent(new InputEventMouseMotion());
            break;
    }
}
```

Implementing this into the editor would be trivial, but making it work at an engine-level would fix the issue for the editor and all games made with Godot.
